Credit Card Transaction Analysis – Key Findings

1. Project Overview

This project analyses a simulated credit card transaction dataset containing 1,296,675 transactions from January 2019 to June 2020.

The objective is to understand transaction patterns, spending behaviour, and characteristics associated with transactions labelled as fraudulent.

